OL,5,CKINNOCK ESCAPES INJURY IN DUBLIN CRASH
OL,6, FDriver dies in car accident...113B213
OL,8,CS AFRICAF58 detained after
OL,9, Fmass anti-apartheid protest...104B204
OL,11,COIL PLATFORMF113 men evacuated
OL,12,F by helicopters in North Sea...107B207
OL,14,CIRAFFormer terrorist freed
OL,15, Ffrom prison in N Ireland......115B215
OL,17,CUNIONSF"confident" says Willis.105B205
OL,18,C
OL,19,CHOWEFdefends deputy's role.....109B209
OL,21,CMISSING MANFSearch stepped up..108B208
