OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, Labour leader Mr Neil Kennock and his
OL,6, wife have been involved in a car crash
OL,7, on their way to Dublin airport.
OL,9,FThey were being driven to the airport
OL,10,Fwhen their driver apparently suffered
OL,11,Fa heart attack, causing their car to
OL,12,Fcollide with a lorry.
OL,14,FThe driver was dead on arrival at the
OL,15,Fcity's Beaumont Hospital.
OL,17,FMr Kinnock was not injured; his wife,
OL,18,FIrish Labour leader Mr Dick Spring and
OL,19,Ftwo Lbbour party staff members also in
OL,20,Fthe car suffered minor injuries. Mr and
OL,21,FMrs Kinnock have resumed their journey.
OL,23,T]CFrom 03-09-89   teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
