OL,1,  V<,,4<,,4<,,4Spp0pp0p``0pp0      G3/8
OL,2,T]V5b(55b(55j5Sj5.%jj5/l4
OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, South African police have said 58
OL,6, supporters of the Mass Democratic
OL,7, Movement were detained during today's
OL,8, mass beach protest.
OL,9,                   F
OL,10,FThousands of black people defied race
OL,11,Flaws by walking on to Durban's whites-
OL,12,Fonly Addington Beach.
OL,14,FThey picnicked, swam and paddled in the
OL,15,Flatest protest of a campaign leading up
OL,16,Fto Wednesday's whites-only elections.
OL,17,F
OL,18,FRadio South Africa said 10 people were
OL,19,Fstill being held for alleged possession
OL,20,Fof the African National Congress flag.
OL,21,FForty-eight others were released.
OL,22,F
OL,23,T]CFrom 03-09-89   teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
FL,182,180,120,250,0,100
