OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F181A1788464144
OL,1,  V<,,4<,,4<,,4Spp0pp0p``0pp0      G4/8
OL,2,T]V5b(55b(55j5Sj5.%jj5/l4
OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, Non-essential personnel were taken off
OL,6, the North-West Hutton oil platform in
OL,7, the North Sea today.
OL,8,F
OL,9,FHelicopters took 113 men to other
OL,10,Fplatforms in the area north-east of
OL,11,FShetland, leaving 75 on board.
OL,12,F
OL,13,FThe evacuation took place after the
OL,14,Fplatform was rocked by a "kick" during
OL,15,Fdrilling, after a high-pressure zone
OL,16,Fwas encountered. No one was hurt.
OL,17,F
OL,18,FThe rig's operators, Amoco, have
OL,19,Freported the situation to be under
OL,20,Fcontrol. Production was shut down as
OL,21,Fa precaution following the incident.
OL,22,F
OL,23,T]CFrom 03-09-89   teletextarchive.com
